- modpack install/update, .mrpack export listing Modrinth hashes
- Mods screen, import progress, task-progress and mods-rolled-back events
- migration 0003; 42 new core tests, 13 new UI tests

Known: npm audit --audit-level=high fails on a new picomatch advisory with no fix (dev tooling only), see docs/NEXT_STEPS.md
